  "rule_description": "JEP 421 terminally deprecated finalization in JDK 18 by annotating finalize() with @Deprecated(forRemoval=true). These four sites are the only warnings in the tree that changed category between 17 and 21: plain [deprecation] on 17, [removal] on 21. Every finalizer here wraps a cleanup method that already exists, so the transform is to delete the override and keep the cleanup reachable. Server.java is the exception -- its finalizer body is live code called explicitly from a finally block.",
  "rule_id": "FINALIZE_DEPRECATED_FOR_REMOVAL",
  "rule_name": "Object.finalize() overrides are deprecated for removal since JDK 18",
